田廣","齊王","齊王廣"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu","c-shiji-008-gaozu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p027","quote":"項王之救彭城，追漢王至滎陽，田橫亦得收齊，立田榮子廣為齊王。漢王之敗彭城，諸侯皆復與楚而背漢。漢軍滎陽，築甬道屬之河，以取敖倉粟。漢之三年，項王數侵奪漢甬道，漢王食乏，恐，請和，割滎陽以西為漢。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p034","quote":"是時項王北擊齊，田榮與戰城陽。田榮敗，走平原，平原民殺之。齊皆降楚。楚因焚燒其城郭，系虜其子女。齊人叛之。田榮弟橫立榮子廣為齊王，齊王反楚城陽。項羽雖聞漢東，既已連齊兵，欲遂破之而擊漢。漢王以故得劫五諸侯兵，遂入彭城。項羽聞之，乃引兵去齊，從魯出胡陵，至蕭，與漢大戰彭城靈壁東睢水上，大破漢軍，多殺士卒，睢水為之不流。乃取漢王父母妻子於沛，置之軍中以為質。當是時，諸侯見楚彊漢敗，還皆去漢復為楚。塞王欣亡入楚。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p044","quote":"淮陰已受命東，未渡平原。漢王使酈生往說齊王田廣，廣叛楚，與漢和，共擊項羽。韓信用蒯通計，遂襲破齊。齊王烹酈生，東走高密。項羽聞韓信已舉河北兵破齊、趙，且欲擊楚，則使龍且、周蘭往擊之。韓信與戰，騎將灌嬰擊，大破楚軍，殺龍且。齊王廣奔彭越。當此時，彭越將兵居梁地，往來苦楚兵，絕其糧食。"}],"rationale":"只在所列原句的秦末楚漢軍事／分封敘事內暫定同指；有前卷錨點時對讀相接事件，不把同名作全庫匹配規則，仍待異源覆核。 第34段田榮弟橫立榮子廣為齊王，第44段齊王田廣叛楚及敗走沿同一齊國敘事，暫定同指並保存原ID。 第44段烹酈生並東走的齊王指田廣，不能連到正在進攻齊國的韓信。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p027","text":"項王之救彭城，追漢王至滎陽，田橫亦得收齊，立田榮子廣為齊王。漢王之敗彭城，諸侯皆復與楚而背漢。漢軍滎陽，築甬道屬之河，以取敖倉粟。漢之三年，項王數侵奪漢甬道，漢王食乏，恐，請和，割滎陽以西為漢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"田橫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000712","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p034","text":"是時項王北擊齊，田榮與戰城陽。田榮敗，走平原，平原民殺之。齊皆降楚。楚因焚燒其城郭，系虜其子女。齊人叛之。田榮弟橫立榮子廣為齊王，齊王反楚城陽。項羽雖聞漢東，既已連齊兵，欲遂破之而擊漢。漢王以故得劫五諸侯兵，遂入彭城。項羽聞之，乃引兵去齊，從魯出胡陵，至蕭，與漢大戰彭城靈壁東睢水上，大破漢軍，多殺士卒，睢水為之不流。乃取漢王父母妻子於沛，置之軍中以為質。當是時，諸侯見楚彊漢敗，還皆去漢復為楚。塞王欣亡入楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"橫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000712","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"齊王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"齊王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0198","start":198,"end":201,"surface":"塞王欣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000606","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p044","text":"淮陰已受命東，未渡平原。漢王使酈生往說齊王田廣，廣叛楚，與漢和，共擊項羽。韓信用蒯通計，遂襲破齊。齊王烹酈生，東走高密。項羽聞韓信已舉河北兵破齊、趙，且欲擊楚，則使龍且、周蘭往擊之。韓信與戰，騎將灌嬰擊，大破楚軍，殺龍且。齊王廣奔彭越。當此時，彭越將兵居梁地，往來苦楚兵，絕其糧食。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"淮陰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000724","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000764","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"田廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000724","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000781","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000764","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000724","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000666","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"周蘭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000782","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000724","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m044-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"灌嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"c